flowchart TB
 Input["Validate input and hard constraints"] --> Kind{"Task"}
 Kind -->|"keyword / wanted"| M7["Frozen M7 RPC, 1.5 s"]
 M7 --> Rule["Validate frozen response, else local rules with degradation reason"]
