 Sem --> Check["Check version, identities, finite scores and constraints"]
 Check -->|"failure"| Lex["Keyword refinement, SEMANTIC_UNAVAILABLE"]
 Check -->|"valid"| Visible["Re-read visibility and entity versions"]
 Rule --> Visible
 Lex --> Visible
 Kind -->|"price"| Price["Frozen M8 rules or unavailable interval"]
 Price --> Manual["Disclaimer and manual pricing"]
 Kind -->|"trust / risk"| Clues["Observed reviews or activity counts, absent signals null"]
 Clues --> Human["Restricted output and administrator review, no automatic action"]
